1:["$","$Ld",null,{"page":{"id":"library--assisted-writing","kind":"library-article","route":"/roadmap/library/assisted-writing","sourceUrl":"https://refold.la/roadmap/library/assisted-writing","sourceHash":"18be4735570cd1ee4318cda73987cd3adc8daeca00a06c8ff2b5425295d0cf84","collectedAt":"2026-09-01T16:52:27.857Z","bodyMode":"authorized-full-body","title":{"en":"Assisted Writing","zh":"辅助写作"},"description":{"en":"","zh":""},"segments":[{"id":"segment-0001","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Assisted writing means writing in the target language with tools available — a dictionary, grammar reference, AI chatbot, or any other resource that helps you produce better text than you could unaided.","zh":"辅助写作是指借助可用工具用目标语言写作——字典、语法参考资料、AI 聊天机器人，或任何其他能帮助你写出比独立完成时更好文本的资源。"}},{"id":"how-it-works","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"How It Works","zh":"如何进行"}},{"id":"segment-0003","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Find a quiet place, open a notepad (physical or digital), and start writing. The topic doesn't matter — a journal entry about your day, an opinion about something, a description of a movie, a message to a friend. What matters is that you're putting your thoughts into the target language.","zh":"找个安静的地方，打开记事本（纸质或电子版），开始写作。主题并不重要——可以写当天的日记、对某件事的看法、对一部电影的描述，或给朋友的留言。重要的是，你正在把自己的想法转化为目标语言。"}},{"id":"segment-0004","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"When you don't know a word, look it up. When you're unsure about a grammar pattern, check it. When a sentence feels wrong, ask an AI chatbot to help you correct it. The goal of assisted writing is to stretch yourself — to write at a level above what you could produce on your own.","zh":"遇到不会的词，就去查。对某个语法模式没有把握，就去核实。如果觉得某个句子不对劲，就请 AI 聊天机器人帮你纠正。辅助写作的目标是挑战自己——写出高于你独立输出水平的内容。"}},{"id":"segment-0005","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Once you're finished, you can also use automated tools (or ask a native) to give you further corrections and comments.","zh":"完成后，你还可以使用自动化工具（或请母语者）提供进一步的纠正和意见。"}},{"id":"segment-0006","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<a href=\"https://refold.la/apps/writing-tutor\">-&gt; Check out our AI Writing Tutor</a>","zh":"<a href=\"https://refold.la/apps/writing-tutor\">-&gt; 试试我们的 AI 写作导师</a>"}},{"id":"why-it-matters","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"Why It Matters","zh":"为什么这很重要"}},{"id":"segment-0008","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Writing builds accuracy in a way that speaking can't. When you write, you have time to think, revise, and correct yourself. This deliberate, slow process is how you develop a feel for what's correct in the language. The accuracy you build through writing eventually transfers to your speech.","zh":"写作能以口语无法做到的方式提升准确性。写作时，你有时间思考、修改和自我纠正。正是这种有意识的缓慢过程，能让你逐渐培养出对语言正确用法的感觉。通过写作建立的准确性最终会迁移到口语中。"}},{"id":"segment-0009","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Writing also reveals gaps in your knowledge that you might not notice while consuming content. You might understand the word \"nevertheless\" when you read it, but can you actually use it correctly in a sentence? Writing forces you to find out.","zh":"写作还会暴露出你在接触内容时可能注意不到的知识缺口。阅读时你或许能理解“尽管如此”这个词，但你真的能在句子中正确使用它吗？写作会迫使你找到答案。"}},{"id":"tips","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"Tips","zh":"建议"}},{"id":"segment-0011","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"en":"Don't overthink topic choice. Writing about anything is better than not writing.","zh":"不要在选择主题上想得太多。无论写什么，都比什么也不写好。"},{"en":"Using tools is the whole point of \"assisted\" writing. Looking things up isn't cheating.","zh":"使用工具正是“辅助”写作的核心。查资料不算作弊。"},{"en":"When you discover a new word or pattern through writing, consider mining it for your flashcards.","zh":"如果你在写作中发现了新词或新模式，可以考虑将其挖掘出来制成闪卡。"},{"en":"If you don't know how to type in the target language, see Typing Practice.","zh":"如果你不知道如何用目标语言打字，请参阅“打字练习”。"},{"en":"Free platforms like <a href=\"https://bearblog.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bearblog</a> or <a href=\"https://journaly.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Journaly</a> let you share your writing publicly, which can be motivating.","zh":"<a href=\"https://bearblog.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bearblog</a> 或 <a href=\"https://journaly.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Journaly</a> 等免费平台可以让你公开分享自己的文章，从而增强学习动力。"}]},{"id":"when-to-start","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"When to Start","zh":"何时开始"}},{"id":"segment-0013","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Assisted writing is introduced in Phase 5A and continues through Phase 7.","zh":"辅助写作从阶段 5A 开始引入，并持续到阶段 7。"}}],"cards":[]}}]
